mb|P|mb|1C|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I like the 1@C bid by East. The hand meets the |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=ruleof20,Rule of 20^*N|CP||FP||at|. In fact, if you use "Bergen adjusted points" to calculate how many "points" are in the hand, the |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=ruleof20,Rule of 20^*N|CP||FP||at| calculation is 21. It is 11 "points" due to 10 HCP and 1 quality (3 honor) suit point and 10 cards in the black suits; 11 + 10 = 21.|

