UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|This hand is tricky to play. North got kind of lucky. The better way to play the hand is to lead a spade before drawing any trump. That way he still has entries and can throw diamond losers on the spades.|
