mb|1S|mb|P|mb|2S|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P|mb|P|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|In Match Points, North definitely should not pass. Letting them play at the 2 level in an 8-card fit is almost always at best average and more often below average. In Match Points I would bid 3@C with the N hand on the theory "if they have a fit we have a fit".|
