nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|The reason being, if they have an 8-card spade fit, we have 5 spades and, therefore, since we hold 26 total cards, we hold 21 cards other than spades meaning, unless we have 3 seven card suits (which is rare but happens to be the case here) we will have at least an 8-card fit somewhere.|
